            "kind": "REWORK",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "lib/mtls_cert_utils.py",
                    "line": 103,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "George Keishing",
                        "email": "gkeishin@gmail.com",
                        "username": "gkeishin"
                    },
                    "message": "Add input validation:\n\n```\nif not ca_cert_pem or not isinstance(ca_cert_pem, str):\n    raise ValueError(\"ca_cert_pem must be a non-empty string\")\nif not ca_key_pem or not isinstance(ca_key_pem, str):\n    raise ValueError(\"ca_key_pem must be a non-empty string\")\nif not ca_cert_pem.strip().startswith('-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----'):\n    raise ValueError(\"ca_cert_pem does not appear to be a valid PEM certificate\")\n```\n\nClear error messages help identify configuration issues quickly"
                },
                {
                    "file": "lib/mtls_cert_utils.py",
                    "line": 301,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "George Keishing",
                        "email": "gkeishin@gmail.com",
                        "username": "gkeishin"
                    },
                    "message": "Add try-except with informative error messages:\n```\n\ntry:\n    with open(cert_path, \"w\") as f:\n        f.write(cert_pem)\n    with open(key_path, \"w\") as f:\n        f.write(key_pem)\nexcept IOError as e:\n    raise IOError(f\"Failed to write certificate files: {e}\") from e\n```\n\nBetter error messages aid debugging when file operations fail."
                },
                {
                    "file": "redfish/managers/lib/mtls_resource.robot",
                    "line": 40,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "George Keishing",
                        "email": "gkeishin@gmail.com",
                        "username": "gkeishin"
                    },
                    "message": "Add validation:\n```\n${hostname}=  Redfish.Get Attribute\n...  /redfish/v1/Managers/${MANAGER_ID}/NetworkProtocol\n...  HostName\nShould Not Be Empty  ${hostname}  msg=BMC hostname is required for UPN certificate generation\n```\n\nPrevents silent failures when hostname is not configured."
                },
                {
                    "file": "redfish/managers/lib/mtls_resource.robot",
                    "line": 210,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "George Keishing",
                        "email": "gkeishin@gmail.com",
                        "username": "gkeishin"
                    },
                    "message": "Replace Sleep with inline verification\n```\nWait Until Keyword Succeeds  30s  2s\n...  Redfish.Get  ${REDFISH_CA_CERTIFICATE_URI}/${resp.dict['Id']}\n...  valid_status_codes=[${HTTP_OK}]\n```\n Dynamic waiting is more reliable across different system speeds and reduces test execution time. The verification ensures the certificate is actually accessible before proceeding."
                },
                {
                    "file": "redfish/managers/lib/mtls_resource.robot",
                    "line": 303,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "George Keishing",
                        "email": "gkeishin@gmail.com",
                        "username": "gkeishin"
                    },
                    "message": "```\nShould Be Equal As Integers  ${code}  ${200}\n...  msg=mTLS authentication failed with status ${code}, expected 200\n```"
                },
                {
                    "file": "redfish/managers/lib/mtls_resource.robot",
                    "line": 318,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "George Keishing",
                        "email": "gkeishin@gmail.com",
                        "username": "gkeishin"
                    },
                    "message": "${HTTP_OK}                               200\ncan we use those those variables instead of the value directly.\n\nrefer lib/rest_response_code.robot"
                },
                {
                    "file": "redfish/managers/lib/mtls_resource.robot",
                    "line": 318,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "George Keishing",
                        "email": "gkeishin@gmail.com",
                        "username": "gkeishin"
                    },
                    "message": "```\nShould Not Be Equal As Integers  ${code}  ${200}\n...  msg=mTLS authentication should have failed but got status ${code}\n```"
                }
